+<summary style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 0; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 500">Q. 블랙헤드와 피지가 많은데 어떤 관리를 받나요?<span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1">+</span></summary>
